  MeshShadowMode: None
  ShadowColor: {x: 1.000000, y: 1.000000, z: 1.000000, w: 1.000000}
  ShadowDensity: 1.000000
  Text: |-
    VolumetricLine draws a smooth 3D tube through a list of scene objects and rebuilds it every frame as they move.
    In this demo the tube follows four drifting control points and cycles through rainbow colors. Walk around it to see it from every side.
